@baseUrl = http://127.0.0.1:6010
@xsrfToken = copy-the-XSRF-TOKEN-cookie-after-GET-api-status
@projectId = 0123456789abcdef01234567

### Initialize request-protection cookies.
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/status

### Local account, monitoring status and latest Updates; never returns device secrets.
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/research/status

### Start linking an existing remote account; open verificationUri in the normal browser.
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/research/account/link
X-XSRF-TOKEN: {{xsrfToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{}

### Explicitly consent to a selected project (204). The ID is the Dummy fixture.
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/research/projects/{{projectId}}
X-XSRF-TOKEN: {{xsrfToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"enabled":true,"consentVersion":"overleaf-foundry-2026-10"}

### Queue an immediate content check (202); no account yields 401.
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/research/sync
X-XSRF-TOKEN: {{xsrfToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{}

### Development Dummy evidence only; route does not exist in Live/Production.
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/development/overleaf/change
X-XSRF-TOKEN: {{xsrfToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{}

### Pause monitoring without deleting knowledge.
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/research/projects/{{projectId}}
X-XSRF-TOKEN: {{xsrfToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"enabled":false,"consentVersion":null}

### Explicitly remove this account's local research index/history, not Overleaf or manual ZIPs.
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/research/projects/{{projectId}}
X-XSRF-TOKEN: {{xsrfToken}}

### Disconnect locally and request remote credential revocation.
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/research/account
X-XSRF-TOKEN: {{xsrfToken}}
